+### BackgroundEvent::NeedsPassword
+
+A platform provider needs the user's password. Prompt the user and send the
+password back in a memfd_secret with the `PasswordEntered` signal. The UI
+Control API sends this as `NotifyNeedsPassword(session_handle, incorrect,
+options)`.
+
+`tag`: `0x14`
+
+`value`: `[b]`, true when the provider rejected the previous password.
+
+### BackgroundEvent::InternalLocked
+
+A platform provider is locked, for example because the user has not
+unlocked their key store yet. Tell the user to unlock it or to choose
+another device. The UI Control API sends this as
+`NotifyInternalLocked(session_handle, options)`.
+
+`tag`: `0x50`
+
+`value`: No associated value.
